    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d689">

                <pb facs="0658" n="560" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg560"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gage to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Treasury Department,<lb/>Office of the Secretary</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington D. C.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1900-01-16"><hi rendition="#italic">January
                                16, 1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your letter dated the 15th instant requesting a copy of the manifest of the
                    British steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Mashona</hi>, seized by the British
                    naval authorities with American shipped goods, and have to state that the
                    collector of customs at New York has been instructed by telegraph to forward
                    such copy.</p>
                <p>Respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">L. J. Gage</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Secretary</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
